\subsubsection{I~Ching Hexagram Inference}

After validation, the input timestamp $t_{\text{bjt}}$
is mapped to a hexagram $h$ and phase angle $\phi_h$:

\begin{equation}
  h,\;\phi_h = \textsc{IChingInfer}(t_{\text{bjt}})
  \label{eq:hexagram-infer}
